*** BUG #21 VULNERABILITY CONFIRMED on actual RTL ***
==================================================
matches_q is a SINGLE flip-flop (rom_ctrl_compare.sv:94)
holding the whole digest-compare result.

A single-bit fault (glitch/EM/laser) can flip matches_q
0->1, turning a mismatch into a valid-ROM signal —
accepting corrupted boot ROM with M-mode privileges.
